# GMS lowers the elemental resistance of everything the wizard attacks and
# hands them final damage besides. Nothing here carries an element, so the
# final damage is the whole of it: GMS's 4x+4% ceiling of 40%, reached at the
# ten levels this masters at rather than the nine it takes there.
name: "Elemental Decrease"
skill_order: 5
description: "Permanently increases Final Damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_MAGE
max_level: 10
base { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 }
